{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ignitement</strong> is a rogue-lite action-RPG set in a haunting world of inner turmoil and elemental fury. You are the <strong>Fire Shaman</strong>, a lone seeker who enters deep meditation to confront the fractured pieces of their own soul. Survive waves of nightmare enemies, unlock devastating fire magic, and ascend through a metaphysical underworld crafted from grief, regret, and rage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No allies. No escape. Only fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845350/extras/899e453832d5759fcb24d14184317d21.poster.avif?t=1764846416\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845350/extras/899e453832d5759fcb24d14184317d21.webm?t=1764846416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845350/extras/899e453832d5759fcb24d14184317d21.mp4?t=1764846416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udd36\u00a0<strong>Explosive Fire Magic</strong>: Wield a unique, custom-made 2D fluid simulation system to unleash fire-based attacks with real weight and impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd36<strong>Solo, Skill-Based Combat</strong>: Face overwhelming odds in isometric third-person combat where every dodge and spell cast matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd36<strong>20-Minute Runs with Climactic Boss Battles</strong>: Survive long enough, and you\u2019ll face terrifying bosses - manifestations of your deepest fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd36<strong>Progression System: </strong>Collect soul-coins\u00a0to unlock skills, curses, and mystical masks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Journey Inward</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845350/extras/95a57f1949649b931151782c520fe41e.poster.avif?t=1764846416\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845350/extras/95a57f1949649b931151782c520fe41e.webm?t=1764846416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845350/extras/95a57f1949649b931151782c520fe41e.mp4?t=1764846416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enemies and bosses aren\u2019t just monsters - they\u2019re <strong>manifestations of your psyche</strong>: regret, rage, pride. Everything is a struggle within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd36<strong>Mask Your Identity</strong>: Choose from ancient masks that alter your starting powers and reflect different aspects of your inner self - each one subtly shifting your experience and dialogue. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd36<strong>Solitary Reflection</strong>: With no companions, mentors, or distractions, your only guide is your own voice - questioning, remembering, and reckoning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845350/extras/e06e31b1031f02cca50b2830e518b4d1.poster.avif?t=1764846416\" width=800 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845350/extras/e06e31b1031f02cca50b2830e518b4d1.webm?t=1764846416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845350/extras/e06e31b1031f02cca50b2830e518b4d1.mp4?t=1764846416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Build, die, adapt, repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a spiritual trial. Every choice shapes your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming Soon. Wishlist now.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <i>Will you master the flame - or be consumed by it?</i> \ud83d\udd25</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845350?t=1764846416","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845350/8eebedf10f536402c97fbac57c27917bb714bd90/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764846416","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845350/228def5f4ab9e968f963fe267aa9be6444279081/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764846416","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845350/228def5f4ab9e968f963fe267aa9be6444279081/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764846416","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains fantasy violence involving non-realistic creatures, including their depiction being killed in combat. There is minor blood shown, limited to fantasy creatures. The game also includes dark fantasy themes with references to religious and satanic elements."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ignitement</strong> is a rogue-lite action-RPG set in a haunting world of inner turmoil and elemental fury. You are the <strong>Fire Shaman</strong>, a lone seeker who enters deep meditation to confront the fractured pieces of their own soul. Survive waves of nightmare enemies, unlock devastating fire magic, and ascend through a metaphysical underworld crafted from grief, regret, and rage.</p><p class=\